{"author": "hattrill", "body": "* **PTHR ID & PTN node:**\nPTN000417420\n[REQUIRED FOR MEIOTIC NUCLEAR DIVISION PROTEIN 1 HOMOLOG (PTHR16255)](http://www.pantherdb.org/panther/family.do?clsAccession=PTHR16255)\n\nHave disputed the source annotation to UniProtKB:Q9NWS8. I don't think that there should be a replacement annotation as [positive regulation of mitochondrial translation](http://amigo.geneontology.org/amigo/term/GO%3A0070131) for BP as it is unclear  where it acts.\n\nCould propagate CC to mitochondrion from UniProtKB:Q9NWS8\n\n", "created_at": "2026-10-20T12:31:50Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["FlyBase", "PAINT annotation", "mitochondrion"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "PAINT issue:PTN000417420", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-10-20T14:25:50Z"}
